        "cooked": "<p>I just got myself a copy of my sentinel of multiverse (yay)</p><p>After playing a while i have a question</p><p>If a card effect is to play some card from trash bin at the end of turn and that played card has end of turn effect, does the end of effect of that played card trigger at that turn (example : rise with the dawn revived citizen tears from trash bin)</p>",
