        "created_at": "2014-09-24T21:33:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I only keep (hero) stuff in played order if it has a triggered phase in which it does its stuff - otherwise I tend to put my played cards in a preferred order so I can see what's what more easily. Otherwise I'd get rather confused and end up missing stuff, especially if playing someone like the Adept (which happens quite often ;)) - in his case I tend to have all the instruments in roughly the same order and then have Harmonies, then Melodies, then Rhythms (though the songs themselves within those groups aren't in any particular order).</p>",
